{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fear and Hope</i>\u00a0has a decision-based narrative gameplay engine that offers the player multiple branching story paths through the game, each with its own unique challenges, puzzles, clues, characters, monsters / enemies, weapons, survival mechanics and other discoveries to explore. Trying to solve all paths provides a good level of replayability allowing players to uncover more of the game's rich lore, world history, and mysteries with each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging mini-game <strong>3D</strong>\u00a0<strong>puzzles</strong>\u00a0integrated throughout the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and inspect\u00a0<strong>clues</strong>\u00a0that change depending on the choices you make</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Games of chance</strong>\u00a0where fortune plays its hand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a025d915ef5d82ade7b4a166d52afed1.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a025d915ef5d82ade7b4a166d52afed1.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a025d915ef5d82ade7b4a166d52afed1.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intriguing <strong>character conversations,\u00a0</strong>interactions and insights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/083ed52a793e9fadc08da80032153eb3.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/083ed52a793e9fadc08da80032153eb3.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/083ed52a793e9fadc08da80032153eb3.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choice and chance based combat situations\u00a0</strong>against various enemies and monsters using a variety of weapons. You may find weapons as hidden clues or obtain them through other means</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survivalist gameplay mechanics</strong> like needing to manage, scavenge and find scarce food and fresh water resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/054dd0319d643c850c6e06e2214d5d09.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/054dd0319d643c850c6e06e2214d5d09.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/054dd0319d643c850c6e06e2214d5d09.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;As the same chain fastens the prisoner and the soldier who guards them, so fear and hope, dissimilar as they are, keep step together.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each belongs to a mind that is in suspense, a mind looking forward to the future. Our memory recalls the tortures of fear, while foresight anticipates them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The present alone makes no person wretched.&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Seneca, Letter V</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Let The Adventure Begin</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake on a path in a strange forest with no idea how you got there or why you are there. There is nothing in your possession outside of the clothes on your back. Shaking off a thick drowsiness and as your mind clears you become determined to find an explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange, new world where things may not be quite what they seem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truths will you uncover, which paths will you follow and where will they take you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will your story be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2835240?t=1768132920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/08791965f1d9342e4101d005b513304761fa273e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768132920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/2e66c78566a9308a950af3d1d03eaffaf6f1248b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768132920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/2e66c78566a9308a950af3d1d03eaffaf6f1248b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768132920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2944260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fear and Hope</i>\u00a0has a decision-based narrative gameplay engine that offers the player multiple branching story paths through the game, each with its own unique challenges, puzzles, clues, characters, monsters / enemies, weapons, survival mechanics and other discoveries to explore. Trying to solve all paths provides a good level of replayability allowing players to uncover more of the game's rich lore, world history, and mysteries with each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging mini-game <strong>3D</strong>\u00a0<strong>puzzles</strong>\u00a0integrated throughout the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and inspect\u00a0<strong>clues</strong>\u00a0that change depending on the choices you make</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"v