tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/119b09d650dfa13803d8ae32818a0148.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survivalist gameplay mechanics</strong> like needing to manage, scavenge and find scarce food and fresh water resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/054dd0319d643c850c6e06e2214d5d09.poster.avif?t=1768132920\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/054dd0319d643c850c6e06e2214d5d09.webm?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/054dd0319d643c850c6e06e2214d5d09.mp4?t=1768132920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;As the same chain fastens the prisoner and the soldier who guards them, so fear and hope, dissimilar as they are, keep step together.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each belongs to a mind that is in suspense, a mind looking forward to the future. Our memory recalls the tortures of fear, while foresight anticipates them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The present alone makes no person wretched.&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Seneca, Letter V</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Let The Adventure Begin</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake on a path in a strange forest with no idea how you got there or why you are there. There is nothing in your possession outside of the clothes on your back. Shaking off a thick drowsiness and as your mind clears you become determined to find an explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange, new world where things may not be quite what they seem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truths will you uncover, which paths will you follow and where will they take you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will your story be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Imaginings Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/a75432200957d3d2df384f90d233e30061d877b9/header.jpg?t=1768132920","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2024-2026 Imaginings Software, DUNS 745750345, ABN 87 493 926 697. All Rights Reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game does not collect or store any user data. Noting that our full privacy policy can be found via the game website, the link to which is in the external links section of this store page.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, Intel or both<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.s